Dear Kavous,

I hope you are doing well! I have received my exam results and I passed, 
so I am from now ready to contact the examination office about the 
thesis registration.

As the first examiner, I will enter Prof. Troncoso in the form as we 
discussed. Also do you have any idea if a second examiner is required? 
Otherwise I will contact the examination office on the matter, and I 
would like to confirm that the title "Understanding Privacy Harm 
Communication in Health Tracking Apps".

For the thesis, I am still working on the points we discussed last time, 
and I will send you an update in the next few days!

Thank you in advance!

Best regards,
Hamza

